{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用前缀和 S 表示当前位置之前所有元素的总和；若此前出现过 S-k，则从那些位置之后到当前位置的子数组之和都等于 k。哈希表记录各前缀和出现次数，并先放入 0→1，以覆盖从数组开头起算的子数组。示例 [1,1,1] 中，扫描到第二、第三个元素时各找到一次匹配，因此答案为 2。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>和为 K 的子数组</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.tag{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px}\n.formula{text-align:center;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.array .cell::after{content:attr(data-i);position:static;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.cell.range{border-color:#3794ff;background:#153b55}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:4px}\n.metric{padding:6px 4px;text-align:center;background:#1c1c1c;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c}\n.metric .label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;display:block}\n.metric .value{font-size:13px;color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:700}\n.question{margin:6px 0;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.found{color:#4ec9b0;font-weight:600}\n.map{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.entry{padding:2px 7px;background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.entry.hit{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.step{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>前缀和 + 出现次数</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\"><span class=\"tag mono\">k = 2</span> · nums = [1,1,1]</p>\n<div class=\"formula mono\">寻找历史前缀和 S − k</div>\n<div class=\"array\" id=\"array\">\n<div class=\"cell num\" data-i=\"0\">1</div><div class=\"cell num\" data-i=\"1\">1</div><div class=\"cell num\" data-i=\"2\">1</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid\">\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"panel-title\">本轮</div>\n<div class=\"metrics\">\n<div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"label\">前缀和 S</span><span class=\"value\" id=\"sum\">0</span></div>\n<div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"label\">找 S-k</span><span class=\"value\" id=\"need\">—</span></div>\n<div class=\"metric\"><span class=\"label\">答案</span><span class=\"value\" id=\"answer\">0</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"question\" id=\"question\">扫描开始前，记录空前缀。</div>\n<div class=\"panel-title\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">历史前缀和</div>\n<div class=\"map\" id=\"map\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"step\" id=\"step\">初始化</div><div class=\"status\" id=\"status\" style=\"margin-top:0\">先放入 <span class=\"mono\">0 → 1</span>。</div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"progress\" style=\"height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;margin-top:8px;border-radius:2px\"><div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\" style=\"height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff\"></div></div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst nums=[1,1,1],k=2,frames=[],history=new Map([[0,1]]),positions=new Map([[0,[-1]]]);\nlet total=0,prefix=0;\nframes.push({i:-1,s:0,n:null,a:0,map:[...history],msg:'扫描前先记录空前缀.',status:'0 → 1 覆盖从索引 0 开始的子数组.'});\nfor(let i=0;i<nums.length;i++){\n prefix+=nums[i];const need=prefix-k,hits=history.get(need)||0;total+=hits;\n const start=positions.get(need)?.[0];\n frames.push({i,s:prefix,n:need,a:total,map:[...history],hit:hits?need:undefined,range:hits?[start+1,i]:undefined,msg:'先查询历史 '+need+', 命中 '+hits+' 次.',status:'答案增加 '+hits+' → '+total+'. 此时尚未记录当前前缀, 避免把空子数组算入答案.'});\n history.set(prefix,(history.get(prefix)||0)+1);positions.set(prefix,[...(positions.get(prefix)||[]),i]);\n frames.push({i,s:prefix,n:need,a:total,map:[...history],msg:'再记录当前前缀 '+prefix+', 频次 '+history.get(prefix)+'.',status:i===nums.length-1?'扫描完成, 最终答案为 '+total+'.':'记录后继续扫描下一个元素.'});\n}\n\nconst cells=[...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')],sum=document.getElementById('sum'),need=document.getElementById('need'),answer=document.getElementById('answer'),question=document.getElementById('question'),map=document.getElementById('map'),step=document.getElementById('step'),status=document.getElementById('status'),bar=document.getElementById('bar');\nlet index=0;\nfunction draw(f){\n cells.forEach((c,j)=>{c.className='cell num';if(j===f.i)c.classList.add('active');if(f.range&&j>=f.range[0]&&j<=f.range[1])c.classList.add('range')});\n sum.textContent=f.s;need.textContent=f.n===null?'—':f.n;answer.textContent=f.a;question.innerHTML=f.msg;step.textContent=f.i<0?'初始化':`扫描索引 ${f.i}`;status.innerHTML=f.status;\n map.innerHTML=f.map.map(([k,v])=>`<span class=\"entry ${k===f.hit?'hit':''}\">${k} → ${v}</span>`).join('');\n bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width='0';requestAnimationFrame(()=>{bar.style.transition='width 2.2s linear';bar.style.width='100%'});\n}\ndraw(frames[0]);setInterval(()=>{index=(index+1)%frames.length;draw(frames[index])},2400);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
